can predict things that are going on inside people's brains. I have a paper like that with a bunch of other co-authors, but there's a few papers along those lines. And then there's lots of papers that are probing the behavior of these systems. looking at whether they do the same kinds of things that humans do when they're given the same kind of stimuli. And so that's interestingly a really good project for psychologists, right? So we as psychologists are used to investigating mysterious systems based just on their behavior. Those systems are normally human beings, but we're getting the chance to use those same research

